WEBVTT

00:00:04.110 --> 00:00:08.490
As long as I communicate my feelings, 
I'm sure even Angie and I can be friends.

00:00:10.390 --> 00:00:11.490
Yes?

00:00:16.610 --> 00:00:17.990
Do you have a minute?

00:00:19.490 --> 00:00:22.410
I know I asked you to mediate 
between me and Bartfort,

00:00:22.410 --> 00:00:24.920
but I'd actually like you 
to get involved, too.

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:28.880
You apparently have good grades.
 I'm sure there's some way you can help.

00:00:29.140 --> 00:00:31.990
I-I wanted to talk to you about that.

00:00:31.990 --> 00:00:34.450
I did introduce you to him, 
but I've changed my mind.

00:00:34.450 --> 00:00:37.290
I'd prefer you not involve Mr. Leon in—

00:00:38.890 --> 00:00:42.890
You'll play along, won't you, commoner?

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:53.440
<b>Trapped in</b>

00:00:53.440 --> 00:00:55.780
<b>a Dating Sim</b>

00:00:55.780 --> 00:01:00.410
<b>Trapped in
a Dating Sim</b>

00:02:16.550 --> 00:02:22.510
This Isn't a Game

00:02:19.050 --> 00:02:23.060
If you refuse to help me, I'll make 
everyone around you miserable,

00:02:23.060 --> 00:02:27.100
including that shithead Bartfort 
and that haughty Angelica.

00:02:28.250 --> 00:02:30.650
I'll send Carla to meet you tomorrow.

00:02:30.650 --> 00:02:34.170
You'd better get your shit together, 
too, or your family is screwed.

00:02:34.170 --> 00:02:35.630
Y-Yes, ma'am.

00:02:36.470 --> 00:02:39.260
Th-This is wrong.

00:02:39.260 --> 00:02:40.260
What?

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:44.440
M-Mr. Leon and Angie are both strong people.

00:02:45.240 --> 00:02:48.650
Even if you threatened them, 
I'm sure they wouldn't give in.

00:02:48.650 --> 00:02:54.070
Nobles don't have friends. 
Angelica knows that better than anyone.

00:02:54.070 --> 00:02:57.390
You're just a pet she keeps around 
to soothe her broken heart.

00:02:57.390 --> 00:02:59.110
Do you not understand that?

00:02:59.110 --> 00:03:00.360
You're wrong!

00:03:00.360 --> 00:03:01.610
No, I'm not.

00:03:01.890 --> 00:03:07.120
I-I'm not a pet. I'm a human!

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:11.250
But if you're friends, that 
means you're equals, right?

00:03:13.670 --> 00:03:17.540
Bartfort is also a noble and 
has some modest achievements.

00:03:17.540 --> 00:03:21.630
Angelica is a true-bred noble with 
both financial and political power.

00:03:21.630 --> 00:03:25.170
And you think you're their equal?

00:03:25.170 --> 00:03:27.140
I-I...

00:03:27.140 --> 00:03:31.480
You can't tell me I'm wrong, can you? 
So you're not friends after all.

00:03:31.480 --> 00:03:35.460
No matter how much you pretend, you're 
just a precious little companion animal.

00:03:38.220 --> 00:03:39.150
Oh, I know.

00:03:39.470 --> 00:03:42.910
Bartfort is probably just after your body.

00:03:43.370 --> 00:03:46.280
He must be going after commoners 
because none of the girls like him.

00:03:46.570 --> 00:03:48.840
Mr. Leon isn't that kind of person!

00:03:48.840 --> 00:03:50.990
Then try taking your clothes 
off and coming on to him.

00:03:50.990 --> 00:03:53.110
He'll jump at the chance.

00:03:54.710 --> 00:03:56.940
Anyway, you're rather impudent.

00:03:56.940 --> 00:03:58.920
I can't believe you thought you were

00:03:58.920 --> 00:04:02.170
on equal footing with us just 
because you got into the academy.

00:04:03.700 --> 00:04:06.680
You need to be punished.

00:04:09.480 --> 00:04:11.080
Sky pirates?

00:04:11.080 --> 00:04:14.740
Yeah. They're rampaging through 
that Carla girl's land.

00:04:14.740 --> 00:04:18.570
She wants me to get rid of them 
because of my prior achievements.

00:04:18.800 --> 00:04:21.190
Shouldn't she ask the royal palace for help?

00:04:22.860 --> 00:04:25.070
I'm sure she would normally,

00:04:25.530 --> 00:04:29.820
but those sky pirates have an item 
essential to the protagonist.

00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:35.160
The protagonist Olivia needs three 
items to eventually awaken her powers

00:04:35.160 --> 00:04:37.330
as the Saint.

00:04:37.660 --> 00:04:41.590
One is the Holy Bracelet hidden 
in the palace dungeon.

00:04:42.140 --> 00:04:45.090
Then there's the Holy Necklace in 
the possession of the sky pirates,

00:04:45.090 --> 00:04:46.590
whom I've been asked to get rid of.

00:04:47.060 --> 00:04:51.230
Finally, there's the Holy Staff 
watched over by the kingdom's temple.

00:04:51.740 --> 00:04:54.940
Normally, the sky pirate event occurs 
two and a half years into the story,

00:04:54.940 --> 00:04:56.730
during the climax of the middle of the game.

00:04:56.730 --> 00:05:01.860
The route splits here according to 
who the protagonist asks for help.

00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:06.910
But behind Carla's request 
is that count's daughter.

00:05:07.640 --> 00:05:10.230
Is she like Angelica?

00:05:10.690 --> 00:05:12.370
Nah, she's scum.

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:17.930
So scummy that even I'm repulsed. 
She's truly vile in person.

00:05:18.500 --> 00:05:23.260
I hoped she'd turn out to actually be 
decent like Angie, but that was wasted hope.

00:05:23.500 --> 00:05:26.780
Anyway, she's also the one who 
lured the sky pirates there.

00:05:26.780 --> 00:05:32.400
In other words, the protagonist gets dragged 
into a fabricated sky pirate crisis.

00:05:32.400 --> 00:05:34.020
Why would she do that?

00:05:34.400 --> 00:05:36.340
Simple jealousy.

00:05:36.340 --> 00:05:37.800
She doesn't like how Livia's

00:05:37.800 --> 00:05:40.490
been slowly establishing herself 
despite being a commoner,

00:05:40.490 --> 00:05:43.030
so she asks her to take out the sky pirates.

00:05:43.030 --> 00:05:47.280
But it looks like I angered her first.

00:05:48.330 --> 00:05:50.280
I can think of plenty of reasons why.

00:05:50.660 --> 00:05:54.420
Are you not prioritizing 
game benefits too much?

00:05:54.420 --> 00:05:56.790
There are few real benefits 
to you doing this.

00:05:57.040 --> 00:06:01.470
I'm just a mob character. I want to avoid 
the game's events as much as possible.

00:06:02.490 --> 00:06:08.320
But the key romantic interests—the prince 
and his friends—are totally useless.

00:06:08.320 --> 00:06:10.800
And I don't want to go down the war route.

00:06:11.400 --> 00:06:17.860
Master, based on what you've told me,
I believe Olivia should resolve this issue.

00:06:17.860 --> 00:06:19.940
Livia can't handle it right now.

00:06:19.940 --> 00:06:23.820
So I'll do it for her. 
It's more efficient this way.

00:06:24.080 --> 00:06:29.160
But won't this make you 
Olivia's romantic interest?

00:06:29.160 --> 00:06:33.080
Me? That won't happen. 
After all, I'm a mob character.

00:06:34.130 --> 00:06:37.080
<i>He doesn't seem to have realized it yet.</i>

00:06:37.770 --> 00:06:43.930
<i>Because he's overprotective of her, 
he's robbing Olivia of opportunities to grow.</i>

00:06:46.680 --> 00:06:47.710
Luxion.

00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:49.720
What is it, Master?

00:06:51.460 --> 00:06:53.220
Is the <i>Partner</i> ready?

00:06:53.220 --> 00:06:56.050
Yes, it's ready to set sail anytime.

00:06:56.050 --> 00:06:58.600
The sky pirates don't 
stand a chance against it.

00:06:59.720 --> 00:07:02.780
<i>The </i>Partner<i> is the ship Luxion built.</i>

00:07:02.780 --> 00:07:05.830
<i>Its exterior and interior are both built so</i>

00:07:05.830 --> 00:07:08.140
<i>they don't appear out of place in this world.</i>

00:07:08.140 --> 00:07:10.110
<i>Apparently its capabilities 
are quite impressive.</i>

00:07:15.120 --> 00:07:18.250
Baron, good morning.

00:07:18.580 --> 00:07:20.620
Thank you for waiting.

00:07:20.850 --> 00:07:24.490
<i>How sneaky. Does she think I didn't notice?</i>

00:07:26.620 --> 00:07:27.690
<i>Livia...</i>

00:07:28.530 --> 00:07:31.070
<i>Did she fail to reconcile with Angie?</i>

00:07:31.670 --> 00:07:36.280
I've actually asked a couple other people 
to help deal with the sky pirates.

00:07:36.280 --> 00:07:37.260
Huh?

00:07:37.260 --> 00:07:39.240
Oh, they're here.

00:07:41.250 --> 00:07:42.290
Ugh!

00:07:45.650 --> 00:07:51.650
This sucks. Why do I have let these 
punks onto my precious <i>Partner</i>?

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:53.560
Who are you calling punks?

00:07:53.560 --> 00:07:55.910
You are truly unpleasant, aren't you?

00:07:55.910 --> 00:08:00.790
I-I'm sorry. I reached out to them, as well.

00:08:00.790 --> 00:08:05.290
Carla is my ex-fiancée and serves 
the Offrey family's daughter.

00:08:05.540 --> 00:08:10.180
She may be my ex-fiancée, 
but I cannot ignore her request for help.

00:08:10.180 --> 00:08:13.390
And the pay I'll receive for defeating 
sky pirates with bounties on their heads

00:08:13.390 --> 00:08:15.050
will help Marie.

00:08:15.290 --> 00:08:18.930
When I heard about that, 
I decided to join in.

00:08:18.930 --> 00:08:21.060
With a single spear?

00:08:21.060 --> 00:08:24.590
I can't help it. My Armor was taken from me.

00:08:24.590 --> 00:08:27.170
I can steal a new suit from the sky pirates.

00:08:27.170 --> 00:08:29.370
Where are Dark Blue, Green, and Light Blue?

00:08:29.370 --> 00:08:31.840
Don't call us by our colors!

00:08:31.840 --> 00:08:34.570
The other three were called back home.

00:08:34.570 --> 00:08:37.010
And because of that, 
I'm stuck accompanying Purple.

00:08:37.010 --> 00:08:38.820
You know, because he's so unreliable.

00:08:38.820 --> 00:08:43.540
Shut up, meathead! I wish Chris 
had come with me instead!

00:08:43.540 --> 00:08:44.830
What was that?!

00:08:46.370 --> 00:08:49.620
<i>What did these two intend to do on their own?</i>

00:08:49.620 --> 00:08:53.340
I-In any case, let's work 
together to get this done.

00:08:53.600 --> 00:08:56.010
Come on, Ms. Olivia. 
Ask them to work together, too.

00:08:59.690 --> 00:09:00.790
<i>Livia...</i>

00:09:05.270 --> 00:09:07.980
<i>Will Livia like this?</i>

00:09:08.430 --> 00:09:11.480
<i>If Leon were around, I could've 
asked him about her preferences.</i>

00:09:13.380 --> 00:09:14.670
What is this?

00:09:15.230 --> 00:09:17.980
Livia! It's me, Angelica!

00:09:18.850 --> 00:09:20.500
Livia, are you there?

00:09:20.500 --> 00:09:22.620
Well, if it isn't Angelica.

00:09:27.180 --> 00:09:28.630
You again?

00:09:29.940 --> 00:09:32.250
She must really hate you.

00:09:32.710 --> 00:09:35.380
Sorry, but I don't have time for you.

00:09:36.330 --> 00:09:40.300
You came all the way here to get 
your pet? You must adore her.

00:09:40.300 --> 00:09:41.760
What are you trying to say?

00:09:42.820 --> 00:09:47.670
Angelica, you need to keep your 
cute little pet tightly leashed.

00:09:47.670 --> 00:09:49.770
It'd be so sad if she were to die.

00:09:49.770 --> 00:09:55.160
I had your pet accompany that back country 
baron on his sky pirate hunting.

00:09:55.160 --> 00:09:58.280
She seemed rather dejected. 
Do you suppose they'll be all right?

00:10:00.090 --> 00:10:03.540
I knew it. You're behind the sky pirates.

00:10:04.590 --> 00:10:05.790
M-My lady!

00:10:06.840 --> 00:10:08.040
Stay out of my way.

00:10:08.650 --> 00:10:10.040
I'll crush you.

00:10:11.890 --> 00:10:13.370
Let go of me!

00:10:13.370 --> 00:10:15.540
Who do you think you are, you fallen noble?

00:10:15.540 --> 00:10:17.180
Say whatever you want.

00:10:17.550 --> 00:10:21.050
But you've made a move on Livia.

00:10:21.730 --> 00:10:23.430
I will end you.

00:10:29.250 --> 00:10:31.560
What's wrong with her?

00:10:32.250 --> 00:10:34.260
<i>I need to contact Leon immediately.</i>

00:10:34.260 --> 00:10:37.320
<i>No, it would be quicker for 
me to head there myself.</i>

00:10:38.770 --> 00:10:40.010
<i>Livia...</i>

00:10:44.030 --> 00:10:48.680
Julius, you don't understand 
your own position.

00:10:49.020 --> 00:10:53.540
There isn't a single airship 
at your command right now.

00:10:53.790 --> 00:10:58.520
But Mother, defeating sky 
pirates is a noble's job.

00:10:58.520 --> 00:11:01.970
Greg and Brad are working 
with Bartfort right now.

00:11:01.970 --> 00:11:04.060
What? Leon is?

00:11:04.060 --> 00:11:07.910
<i>M-Mother! Please come to your senses!</i>

00:11:07.910 --> 00:11:10.680
I-In any case, you can't go.

00:11:10.680 --> 00:11:13.560
Let Baron Bartfort handle this matter.

00:11:13.560 --> 00:11:17.070
Wh-Why is he allowed when I'm not?

00:11:17.070 --> 00:11:20.820
Your failure to understand that 
is why I can't let you go.

00:11:32.450 --> 00:11:34.580
I win.

00:11:35.990 --> 00:11:37.730
You're kidding! You cheated!

00:11:37.730 --> 00:11:39.490
This is impossible!

00:11:39.490 --> 00:11:42.380
That's what losers always say.

00:11:42.660 --> 00:11:45.010
<i>Yeah, I did cheat, though.</i>

00:11:45.010 --> 00:11:47.760
<i>Luxion made these cards with shifting faces.</i>

00:11:47.990 --> 00:11:51.520
<i>I'll be taking all their money 
in place of airfare.</i>

00:11:51.520 --> 00:11:55.610
Challenging this guy to a 
respectable contest was a mistake.

00:11:55.610 --> 00:11:57.270
Absolutely.

00:11:57.970 --> 00:11:59.380
Hey, Brad.

00:11:59.380 --> 00:12:00.530
Hmm?

00:12:01.050 --> 00:12:06.550
What kind of girl is your 
ex-fiancée, Stephanie Offrey?

00:12:07.870 --> 00:12:11.960
I only met her a few times 
before we were engaged,

00:12:11.960 --> 00:12:15.410
and I talked to her only a 
handful of times at the academy.

00:12:15.750 --> 00:12:18.920
So it was a typical political marriage, then.

00:12:19.410 --> 00:12:23.430
Honestly, she's got a bad reputation. 
They say she's quite the party girl.

00:12:23.790 --> 00:12:26.830
But the Offreys played a major 
role in securing diplomatic ties

00:12:26.830 --> 00:12:28.730
with the Fanoss Dukedom.

00:12:29.160 --> 00:12:32.680
Because of that, we don't have 
to fear the Black Knight.

00:12:33.390 --> 00:12:34.950
<i>The Black Knight...</i>

00:12:34.950 --> 00:12:38.850
<i>He's the strongest knight of the 
neighboring Fanoss Dukedom.</i>

00:12:39.190 --> 00:12:42.190
<i>He killed me a bunch of times in the game.</i>

00:12:42.190 --> 00:12:46.850
My family is responsible for defending 
the border along the dukedom.

00:12:47.210 --> 00:12:52.200
Because of the Offreys' achievements, 
I couldn't refuse an engagement to her.

00:12:52.200 --> 00:12:54.960
I'm surprised you were able to call it off.

00:12:54.960 --> 00:12:57.480
There was a pretty big fight about it.

00:12:57.480 --> 00:13:00.370
Ms. Carla hinted at calling 
off the engagement

00:13:00.370 --> 00:13:03.030
when she asked me to help 
deal with the sky pirates.

00:13:03.930 --> 00:13:06.500
Marriage is rough.

00:13:06.500 --> 00:13:09.970
I only met my ex-fiancée a few times, too.

00:13:10.620 --> 00:13:14.150
<i>These romantic interests receive 
all sorts of special treatment,</i>

00:13:14.510 --> 00:13:17.100
<i>but they've got a lot to deal with, too.</i>

00:13:18.090 --> 00:13:20.620
Master, the welcoming party has arrived.

00:13:21.750 --> 00:13:25.860
Two sky pirate ships are approaching.

00:13:26.440 --> 00:13:30.370
Time for work, you two. Get to it.

00:13:32.870 --> 00:13:35.870
I'm telling you to get ready 
because enemies are coming!

00:13:36.430 --> 00:13:38.250
Th-They are?

00:13:38.250 --> 00:13:39.570
Get ready how?

00:13:39.570 --> 00:13:41.630
Are you guys serious?

00:13:42.030 --> 00:13:44.950
Forget it. Just wait inside the ship.

00:13:45.630 --> 00:13:47.690
J-Just wait?

00:13:47.690 --> 00:13:49.390
Let us fight, too!

00:13:49.710 --> 00:13:52.560
Luxion, activate Arroganz.

00:13:52.560 --> 00:13:53.890
Yes, Master.

00:13:58.260 --> 00:14:00.040
Looks like a pretty big one.

00:14:00.040 --> 00:14:03.150
The boss will be delighted if we 
can get our hands on that ship.

00:14:04.010 --> 00:14:07.300
Are there really only five kids on the ship?

00:14:07.300 --> 00:14:10.810
Yeah. Three guys and two women.

00:14:10.810 --> 00:14:13.790
The blue-haired girl is on our side, 
so you'd better not touch her.

00:14:13.790 --> 00:14:17.460
<i>Come on, boys. Let's show them 
what a real fight looks like!</i>

00:14:17.460 --> 00:14:18.790
Yeah!

00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:21.040
Yahoo!

00:14:23.830 --> 00:14:27.300
Today should be an easy day 
thanks to those dumb kids.

00:14:28.350 --> 00:14:31.180
Huh? What's that armor?

00:14:34.510 --> 00:14:38.020
These pirates are Winged Sharks, right?

00:14:38.020 --> 00:14:41.690
They're low-level grunts, 
but there's a main force elsewhere.

00:14:42.150 --> 00:14:44.770
That's a pretty outdated model.

00:14:44.770 --> 00:14:46.820
What he can do all by himself?

00:14:47.560 --> 00:14:49.070
Here he comes.

00:14:50.070 --> 00:14:50.570
What?!

00:14:56.870 --> 00:14:58.330
Why, you...

00:15:01.370 --> 00:15:02.830
Who the hell is this guy?!

00:15:17.090 --> 00:15:19.350
What are you doing? Shoot him down!

00:15:31.080 --> 00:15:33.350
No wonder we were no match for him.

00:15:33.350 --> 00:15:35.620
We won't have a chance to steal any armor.

00:15:36.350 --> 00:15:39.220
So this is a real battle.

00:15:39.620 --> 00:15:44.840
R-Retreat! Retreat! Bring us around! Turn!

00:15:46.100 --> 00:15:47.630
Firing missiles.

00:15:54.140 --> 00:15:56.390
We're being bombarded! Details unknown!

00:15:57.170 --> 00:15:59.210
Activate the magic barrier!

00:15:59.210 --> 00:16:02.410
It was already up. He penetrated 
it with a single blast.

00:16:02.410 --> 00:16:03.970
He what?!

00:16:08.410 --> 00:16:12.450
We have to surrender. Raise the white flag.

00:16:18.460 --> 00:16:21.150
Damn it! Who the hell are you guys?

00:16:21.150 --> 00:16:23.420
Hey, give me a hand here, meathead.

00:16:23.640 --> 00:16:27.420
<i>I had no idea what real battles were like.</i>

00:16:28.300 --> 00:16:31.660
<i>I was just a cocky kid.</i>

00:16:32.860 --> 00:16:35.700
I think we've disabled all of them.

00:16:35.700 --> 00:16:38.550
Wouldn't it have been 
quicker to shoot them down?

00:16:38.550 --> 00:16:40.930
Escorting them will take a 
considerable amount of effort.

00:16:40.930 --> 00:16:45.940
Yeah, I don't have the mentality 
required to cheerily kill people.

00:16:46.190 --> 00:16:50.440
That may eventually cause you to fail.

00:16:50.710 --> 00:16:56.200
Even so, I want to remain 
as normal as possible.

00:16:56.200 --> 00:16:58.200
H-How?

00:16:58.200 --> 00:17:00.650
How did they lose so easily?

00:17:00.650 --> 00:17:03.710
At this rate, we'll arrive at my home!

00:17:04.570 --> 00:17:07.260
Why can't I get in touch with them?

00:17:07.260 --> 00:17:10.210
I haven't mentioned anything 
about this to my family!

00:17:10.510 --> 00:17:13.880
I-I know. That commoner girl...

00:17:13.880 --> 00:17:15.720
If I make this her fault...

00:17:16.380 --> 00:17:21.030
Then Bartfort will surely forgive me.

00:17:24.930 --> 00:17:27.670
The sun's starting to set earlier.

00:17:28.550 --> 00:17:30.580
How can you be so calm?!

00:17:30.580 --> 00:17:33.900
I have no idea whether 
you're amazing or useless!

00:17:33.900 --> 00:17:36.610
Don't lose your heads. I'm in 
an uncomfortable position, too.

00:17:36.970 --> 00:17:38.520
Lower your guns.

00:17:39.490 --> 00:17:41.370
Ah, I thought so.

00:17:42.060 --> 00:17:44.120
Lord Brad, correct?

00:17:44.120 --> 00:17:46.500
Huh? Yes...

00:17:46.890 --> 00:17:49.810
I am Conrad Fou Wayne, lord of this land.

00:17:49.810 --> 00:17:53.510
We met previously at Marquess Field's party.

00:17:53.510 --> 00:17:55.550
Ah, yes. Sir Wayne.

00:17:55.550 --> 00:17:57.510
<i>He totally forgot who he was.</i>

00:17:57.790 --> 00:18:01.130
Why are we being surrounded?

00:18:01.130 --> 00:18:05.350
We came here to help because your 
daughter requested our assistance.

00:18:05.350 --> 00:18:07.520
Carla requested your assistance?

00:18:08.220 --> 00:18:11.640
H-He's mistaken. I simply went 
to discuss a matter with them,

00:18:11.640 --> 00:18:13.770
and that girl blew it out of proportion.

00:18:13.770 --> 00:18:14.440
Huh?

00:18:14.440 --> 00:18:16.030
What's going on here?

00:18:16.030 --> 00:18:18.050
I-I...

00:18:18.050 --> 00:18:20.980
Your daughter asked Olivia 
for an introduction

00:18:20.980 --> 00:18:24.040
because she wanted to request my assistance.

00:18:24.040 --> 00:18:26.540
That's why we came to get 
rid of the sky pirates.

00:18:26.540 --> 00:18:28.620
And who are you?

00:18:28.620 --> 00:18:31.050
He's Leon Fou Bartfort.

00:18:31.050 --> 00:18:32.770
I'm sure you've heard rumors about him.

00:18:32.770 --> 00:18:36.550
M-My lord, forgive my insolence.

00:18:36.550 --> 00:18:41.210
But my land isn't threatened by sky pirates.

00:18:41.740 --> 00:18:43.050
What do you mean?

00:18:43.050 --> 00:18:47.150
I... It's not my fault!

00:18:47.150 --> 00:18:48.560
It was that commoner!

00:18:48.910 --> 00:18:51.580
Hey, don't try to pin this on Livia.

00:18:51.580 --> 00:18:56.070
I-I'm terribly sorry. My daughter 
seems to be confused.

00:18:56.070 --> 00:19:02.070
Sir, your daughter invited us here. 
She promised to pay us.

00:19:03.070 --> 00:19:05.580
You think you can dismiss 
this as a simple mistake?

00:19:05.580 --> 00:19:08.230
This isn't a game.

00:19:08.580 --> 00:19:13.210
C-Carla, what is the meaning 
of this? Explain yourself!

00:19:13.210 --> 00:19:15.550
I-I...

00:19:19.020 --> 00:19:22.220
I can't understand you if 
you're crying! What happened?

00:19:22.700 --> 00:19:24.040
Carla!

00:19:30.200 --> 00:19:33.730
That girl ended up telling us everything.

00:19:34.010 --> 00:19:36.980
It took even less than I expected.

00:19:36.980 --> 00:19:40.990
When I told her what the pirates had 
told me, she confessed to everything.

00:19:41.220 --> 00:19:46.490
L-Lady Stephanie of the Offrey 
family ordered me to do it.

00:19:46.760 --> 00:19:50.250
That said, there's still the 
main force of the sky pirates.

00:19:50.650 --> 00:19:54.000
And we still haven't acquired 
the Saint item Livia needs.

00:19:54.450 --> 00:19:58.500
I believe there's a problem 
we need to resolve first.

00:19:59.150 --> 00:20:02.060
Yeah, you're right.

00:20:05.030 --> 00:20:06.140
I'm coming in.

00:20:08.830 --> 00:20:11.130
Man, I'm beat.

00:20:11.130 --> 00:20:15.180
Why don't we see how things go tomorrow 
and take things easy for a little while?

00:20:20.510 --> 00:20:21.560
Livia—

00:20:20.780 --> 00:20:23.190
Mr. Leon, you're amazing.

00:20:23.670 --> 00:20:27.780
You resolve everything by yourself 
and can do everything yourself.

00:20:27.780 --> 00:20:28.690
Huh?

00:20:29.970 --> 00:20:32.080
A-Are you okay?

00:20:32.080 --> 00:20:34.790
You look pale. Do you have a fever?

00:20:37.710 --> 00:20:41.210
Why are you so kind to me?

00:20:41.210 --> 00:20:43.720
Uh... Because I...

00:20:44.070 --> 00:20:48.350
It doesn't make sense. I'm a commoner.

00:20:48.980 --> 00:20:52.230
Is there a reason for you to help me?

00:20:55.590 --> 00:20:57.230
Are you after my body?

00:20:57.810 --> 00:20:58.730
No!

00:21:00.220 --> 00:21:04.200
Of course not. I'm not even cute.

00:21:04.670 --> 00:21:06.700
Hey, what are you...

00:21:06.700 --> 00:21:11.350
Angie is pretty and a nobleman's daughter.

00:21:12.090 --> 00:21:15.210
But I have nothing to offer.

00:21:16.060 --> 00:21:18.830
There's no reason for you to be 
so kind to me when I have nothing.

00:21:21.290 --> 00:21:25.290
<i>I was nice to Olivia because 
she's the game's protagonist and</i>

00:21:25.290 --> 00:21:27.220
<i>will eventually become the Saint.</i>

00:21:27.870 --> 00:21:29.380
<i>I saw her as...</i>

00:21:32.340 --> 00:21:35.820
If there's no reason for your kindness, 
are you just doing this on a whim?

00:21:36.980 --> 00:21:39.910
I wanted to become friends 
with the two of you,

00:21:40.410 --> 00:21:43.500
but this is no different from being your pet.

00:21:44.330 --> 00:21:48.240
I'm a human! I'm not some companion animal!

00:21:55.080 --> 00:21:57.750
<b>Trapped in a Dating Sim</b>

00:23:25.900 --> 00:23:28.260
Livia, I brought you some 
limited-edition sweets.

00:23:28.260 --> 00:23:29.340
Thank you.

00:23:28.510 --> 00:23:30.260
Miss, have some tea and cake.

00:23:30.260 --> 00:23:31.380
Thank you.

00:23:30.510 --> 00:23:31.950
These baked sweets are tasty, as well.

00:23:31.950 --> 00:23:32.640
I've got tarts, too.

00:23:32.640 --> 00:23:33.500
And have some of this.

00:23:33.500 --> 00:23:34.360
Would you like seconds?

00:23:35.140 --> 00:23:37.520
Next time, "I'm Just a Doormat."

00:23:37.520 --> 00:23:39.980
Guys, please stop feeding me so much!
